==Battleground==
*1 [[Ms. Madonna]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] units for the St. Pigges such as [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] or [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Luxury Bath Cat]]. For Ms. Madonna's waves, you will want [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or some other [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] cats. You can also farm money off of the Mooths by using [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]] or a [[Talents|talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]].

